{"unit_id": "tag:01O5:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n我们简要讨论如何在相对情形（relative setting）下处理分次（graded）模（modules）。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n我们处于情形<REF_0001>中。因此，<MATH_0001>是一个概形（scheme），而<MATH_0002>是一个拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的分次（graded）<MATH_0003>代数（algebra）。设<MATH_0004>是一个分次（graded）<MATH_0005>模（module），作为<MATH_0006>模（module）是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的。我们将描述<MATH_0007>上相伴的拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），它是一个模（modules）层。我们先描述这个层（sheaf）在概形（schemes）<MATH_0008>上的取值，其中这些对象映入（mapping）相对射影谱（relative Proj）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n设<MATH_0009>是一个概形（scheme）。设<MATH_0010>是<MATH_0011>上的一个四元组（quadruple），如第<REF_0002>节所述。我们如下定义拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）<MATH_0012>，它是一个<MATH_0013>模（modules）层：\n<MATH_0014>\n因此，<MATH_0015>是次数（degree）为<MATH_0016>的部分，取自张量积（tensor product），所涉及的两个分次（graded）<MATH_0017>模（modules）为<MATH_0018>和<MATH_0019>。注意，虽然记号中省略了这一依赖关系，层（sheaf）<MATH_0020>仍依赖于该四元组（quadruple）。这个构造具有如下良好性质：给定任意态射（morphism）<MATH_0021>，都有\n<MATH_0022>\n其中<MATH_0023>表示拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），它与拉回（pullback）四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0024>相伴。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n由于（<REF_0003>）中的所有层（sheaves）都是拟凝聚（quasi-coherent）的，我们可以在仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0025>上具体写出这个构造，其中它映入（maps）一个仿射开集（affine open）<MATH_0026>。具体而言，假设<MATH_0027>对应于分次（graded）<MATH_0028>代数（algebra）<MATH_0029>，<MATH_0030>对应于分次（graded）<MATH_0031>模（module）<MATH_0032>，而<MATH_0033>对应于可逆（invertible）<MATH_0034>模（module）<MATH_0035>。映射（map）<MATH_0036>给出分次（graded）<MATH_0037>代数映射（algebra map）<MATH_0038>。（取<MATH_0039>在<MATH_0040>上的张量幂（Tensor powers）。）于是<MATH_0041>是拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），与下列<MATH_0042>模（module）相伴：\n<MATH_0043>\n根据假设，我们甚至可以把<MATH_0044>用仿射开集（affine opens）<MATH_0045>覆盖，使得存在某个<MATH_0046>，满足<MATH_0047>作为<MATH_0048>基（basis）生成模（module）<MATH_0049>。在这种情况下，<MATH_0050>的任意元素（element）都是纯张量（pure tensors）<MATH_0051>之和（sum），其中<MATH_0052>。事实上，可将每个<MATH_0053>乘以<MATH_0054>的适当正次幂（positive power），再合并各项（terms），从而看出<MATH_0055>的每个元素（element）都可写成<MATH_0056>，其中<MATH_0057>且<MATH_0058>。换言之，在这种情况下有\n<MATH_0059>\n其中映射（map）<MATH_0060>就是映射（map）<MATH_0061>。换言之，这是将<MATH_0062>在<MATH_0063>上的取值拉回（pulled back）到<MATH_0064>所得，所用的态射（morphism）<MATH_0065>来自<MATH_0066>。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "relative setting", "target_term": "相对情形"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "algebra", "target_term": "代数"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "schemes", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "mapping", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "relative Proj", "target_term": "相对射影谱"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "degree", "target_term": "次数"}, {"source_term": "tensor product", "target_term": "张量积"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "pullback", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "sheaves", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent", "target_term": "拟凝聚"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映入"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_