{"unit_id": "tag:01O7:statement", "translation": "在情形<REF_0001>中，对于任意拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf），若它是分次（graded）<MATH_0001>模（modules）层<MATH_0002>且定义在<MATH_0003>上，则存在一个典范的（canonical）相伴的层（sheaf），它是一个<MATH_0004>模（modules）层<MATH_0005>，具有下列性质：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 给定一个概形（scheme）<MATH_0006>和一个四元组（quadruple）<MATH_0007>，后者在<MATH_0008>上并对应于态射（morphism）<MATH_0009>，则有典范同构（canonical isomorphism）\n<MATH_0010>\n其中<MATH_0011>由（<REF_0002>）定义。\n<STRUCT_0003> 第（1）项中的同构（isomorphisms）与拉回（pullbacks）相容。\n<STRUCT_0004> 存在典范映射（canonical map）\n<MATH_0012>\n<STRUCT_0005> 构造<MATH_0013>关于<MATH_0014>是函子性的（functorial）。\n<STRUCT_0006> 构造<MATH_0015>是正合的（exact）。\n<STRUCT_0007> 存在典范的（canonical）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0016>\n如引理<REF_0003>所述。\n<STRUCT_0008> 存在典范的（canonical）映射（maps）\n<MATH_0017>\n它们推广了（<REF_0004>）。\n<STRUCT_0009> 构造<MATH_0018>的操作可交换（commutes）于基变换（base change）。\n<STRUCT_0010>\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合的"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "引理任取的分次模层。"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "修饰作为输入的模。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "说明输入层是分次模层。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "修饰存在的相伴层。"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "引理所断言存在的相伴对象。"}, {"source_term": "modules", "target_term": "模", "context": "说明相伴层是模层。"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "第一项中给定的对象。"}, {"source_term": "quadruple", "target_term": "四元组", "context": "第一项中与态射对应的数据。"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射", "context": "由所给四元组对应的态射。"}, {"source_term": "canonical isomorphism", "target_term": "典范同构", "context": "第一项中给出的同构。"}, {"source_term": "isomorphisms", "target_term": "同构", "context": "第一项中与拉回相容的同构。"}, {"source_term": "pullbacks", "target_term": "拉回", "context": "与第一项中的同构相容的操作。"}, {"source_term": "canonical map", "target_term": "典范映射", "context": "第三项中给出的映射。"}, {"source_term": "functorial", "target_term": "函子性的", "context": "第四项说明构造关于给定对象的性质。"}, {"source_term": "exact", "target_term": "正合的", "context": "第五项说明构造的正合性。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "修饰第六项中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第六项中如所引引理所述的映射。"}, {"source_term": "canonical", "target_term": "典范的", "context": "修饰第七项中的映射。"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映射", "context": "第七项中推广所引公式的映射。"}, {"source_term": "commutes", "target_term": "可交换", "context": "描述构造与基变换之间的关系。"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换", "context": "第八项中与构造可交换的操作。"}], "notes": []}
